/F2 12 Tf 50 690 Td (1. Data Controller Identification and Regulatory Scope) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 674 Td (Best Star Group FZE acts as the sovereign data controller for personal and corporate data collected across this portal.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 660 Td (We adhere to UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45/2021 regarding Personal Data Protection (PDPL) and GDPR best practices.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 646 Td (Data collection applies to commercial RFPs, executive candidate dossiers, media inquiries, and investor relations.) Tj
