/F1 9 Tf 50 608 Td (Candidate Data: Full legal name, curriculum vitae, professional licensing credentials, and contact coordinates.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 594 Td (Commercial Data: Enterprise registration, project scopes, procurement tenders, and institutional banking details.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 580 Td (Digital Telemetry: IP addresses, browser encryption handshakes, language preferences, and audit session telemetry.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 50 558 Td (3. Information Security, Encryption Protocols & Data Sovereignty) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 542 Td (All transmitted information is safeguarded utilizing enterprise-grade TLS 1.3 cryptographic protocols.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 528 Td (Stored records are encrypted at rest with AES-256 standard within secure regional cloud and local infrastructure.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 514 Td (Under no circumstances does Best Star Group sell, monetize, or disclose candidate or client information to third parties.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 50 492 Td (4. Data Subject Rights & Dedicated Data Protection Officer (DPO)) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 476 Td (Individuals possess the statutory right to request access, rectification, or complete erasure of their submitted data.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 462 Td (Official inquiries regarding data sovereignty may be directed to our Data Protection Office at compliance@beststargroup.com.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 50 448 Td (All verified data access requests are formally addressed within 15 business days under UAE PDPL guidelines.) Tj
